{"id":"add061435570e03f","group":"20","path":"20/20-cor-turing-degrees-not-lattice.md","title":"全部 Turing 度不是格","display":"cor-turing-degrees-not-lattice — 全部 Turing 度不是格","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-cor-turing-degrees-not-lattice","aliases":["20-cor-turing-degrees-not-lattice"],"display":"cor-turing-degrees-not-lattice — 全部 Turing 度不是格","chapter":"6","section":"6.5","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"Corollary 6.5.5","source_pdf_pages":[176],"source_printed_pages":[142],"depends_on":["[[20-thm-exact-pair]]","[[20-df-usl]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-cor-turing-degrees-not-lattice"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-cor-turing-degrees-not-lattice</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-turing-degrees-not-lattice — 全部 Turing 度不是格"},{"key":"chapter","html":"6"},{"key":"section","html":"6.5"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Corollary 6.5.5"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>176</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>142</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f1ca4420af66074c\" href=\"?note=f1ca4420af66074c\" title=\"20-thm-exact-pair\">20-thm-exact-pair</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1c5e73270aea4f93\" href=\"?note=1c5e73270aea4f93\" title=\"20-df-usl\">20-df-usl</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>取任意严格递增度序列及其精确对。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f1ca4420af66074c\" href=\"?note=f1ca4420af66074c\" title=\"20-thm-exact-pair\">20-thm-exact-pair</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1c5e73270aea4f93\" href=\"?note=1c5e73270aea4f93\" title=\"20-df-usl\">20-df-usl</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}turing\\text{-}degrees\\text{-}not\\text{-}lattice}\\vdash\n\\exists\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b\\in\\mathcal D\\\n\\neg\\exists\\mathbf c\\\n[\\mathbf c\\le\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b\\land\n\\forall\\mathbf d\\ ((\\mathbf d\\le\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b)\\Rightarrow\\mathbf d\\le\\mathbf c)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}turing\\text{-}degrees\\text{-}not\\text{-}lattice}\\vdash\n\\exists\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b\\in\\mathcal D\\\n\\neg\\exists\\mathbf c\\\n[\\mathbf c\\le\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b\\land\n\\forall\\mathbf d\\ ((\\mathbf d\\le\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b)\\Rightarrow\\mathbf d\\le\\mathbf c)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>共同下界如有最大元，由精确对条件落在某个序列成员下，而下一成员仍是更大的共同下界。这里证明全部度结构非格，不能据此自动断言 c.e. 度结构也非格。</p>\n<p>来源：Corollary 6.5.5；印刷页 142；PDF 第 176 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-thm-exact-pair","status":"resolved","id":"f1ca4420af66074c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-exact-pair]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-usl","status":"resolved","id":"1c5e73270aea4f93","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-usl]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-exact-pair","status":"resolved","id":"f1ca4420af66074c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","headin